:: MP Region Moment Foghorn 6 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "sea">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>>守塔人旧居外侧的导雨石槽被风吹落的枯枝堵住，积水正往储盐木柜的透气孔倒灌。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpRegMom_foghorn_6 is 1>>
这处暗格今天已经仔细查验过，眼下并无新的动静。
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[深入 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Foghorn 7]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-region-moment-foghorn-6">
<<mpfarmicon>><<if ($athletics or 0) gte 250 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250>><<link "扒开石槽枯枝 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#act-mp-region-moment-foghorn-6">>
<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 250 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpRegMom_foghorn_6 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg_mom_foghorn_6")>><<money 280>><</if>>积水哗啦一声顺着排水道泻入海崖，你在槽底摸到一枚卡住的铜锚扣。<span class="green">储盐柜保住了干燥。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[深入 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Foghorn 7]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	檐口积水溅进领口，铁钩在青石边滑脱了一下。<span class="red">你被冷水激得打了个寒战。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Foghorn 6]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回雾角栈桥 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[扒开石槽枯枝 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "扒开石槽枯枝">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "运动等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 家政等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<if ($tending or 0) gte 250 or ($physique or 10000) gte 11300>><<link "铺毡压住气孔 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-region-moment-foghorn-6">>
<<if ($tending or 0) gte 250 or ($physique or 10000) gte 11300>>
	<<set $daily.mpRegMom_foghorn_6 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg_mom_foghorn_6_alt")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span><</if>><<skulduggery 1>>双层油毡将雨水严密隔开，柜角夹缝里露出一小包防潮火柴。<span class="green">你妥善护住了旧居的存盐。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[前往别处 (0:04)|MP Region Foghorn Pier]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	油毡边角被海风掀起，抽打在你的手背上。<span class="red">你按住油毡先退回屋檐下。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gtiredness>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Foghorn 6]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回雾角灯塔 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[铺毡压住气孔 (0:07)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "铺毡压住气孔">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "照料等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 体魄：11300">><<pass 7>><</link>><</if>>
</div>
<</if>>


:: MP Region Moment Foghorn 7 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "sea">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>>海蚀回音廊尽头的潮位标尺被牡蛎壳覆满，退潮刻度下隐约露出一格嵌在岩壁里的铜环。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpRegMom_foghorn_7 is 1>>
今日的事宜已料理妥当，无需在此处重复费神。
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[深入 (0:04)|MP Region Encounter Foghorn 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-region-moment-foghorn-7">
<<mpclockworkicon>><<if ($physique or 10000) gte 11400 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250>><<link "铲除表面牡蛎 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#act-mp-region-moment-foghorn-7">>
<<if ($physique or 10000) gte 11400 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpRegMom_foghorn_7 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg_mom_foghorn_7")>><<money 320>><</if>>牡蛎壳应声剥落，你拉动铜环从暗孔里抽出一只密封锡管。<span class="green">锡管里装着旧港守塔津贴券。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[探查异动 (0:04)|MP Region Encounter Foghorn 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	锋利的牡蛎壳划破了指尖，海浪拍湿了靴筒。<span class="red">你连忙甩干手指退上高处石台。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Foghorn 7]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回雾角栈桥 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[铲除表面牡蛎 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "铲除表面牡蛎">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "体魄：11400 或 诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 260 or ($history or 0) gte 260>><<link "摸索回音壁暗锁 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-region-moment-foghorn-7">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 260 or ($history or 0) gte 260>>
	<<set $daily.mpRegMom_foghorn_7 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg_mom_foghorn_7_alt")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span><</if>><<history 1>>你听准空腔回音按下活石，锡管顺着石槽滑进掌心。<span class="green">你凭声学巧劲解开了石壁暗格。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[前往别处 (0:04)|MP Region Foghorn Pier]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	潮水轰鸣震得耳膜嗡嗡作响，一时辨不出空腔位置。<span class="red">你揉了揉耳朵暂且退回栈桥。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gtiredness>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Foghorn 7]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回雾角灯塔 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[摸索回音壁暗锁 (0:07)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "摸索回音壁暗锁">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "科学等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 历史等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 7>><</link>><</if>>
</div>
<</if>>


:: MP Region Encounter Foghorn 1 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "sea">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>>雾角栈桥背风侧的系船石墩裂开一道斜缝，潮水退去后露出半截涂着白漆的信号浮筒。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Pier]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpRegEnc_foghorn_1 is 1>>
周围一切平静如常，今天不必再往里翻检了。
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[深入 (0:04)|MP Region Encounter Foghorn 2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
<div id="enc-foghorn-1">
<<mpsewicon>><<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($science or 0) gte 260>><<link "别开石缝取筒 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#enc-foghorn-1">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($science or 0) gte 260>>
	<<set $daily.mpRegEnc_foghorn_1 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg_enc_foghorn_1")>><<money 300>><</if>>浮筒内胆干燥，夹着一张守塔人留下的航标津贴券。<span class="green">你从石墩斜缝里起出了信号浮筒。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[探查异动 (0:04)|MP Region Encounter Foghorn 2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	石缝湿滑让铁钎打滑，咸水溅湿了袖口。<span class="red">你甩去水珠退后半步。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Encounter Foghorn 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回雾角栈桥 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Pier]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[别开石缝取筒 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "别开石缝取筒">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 科学等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<if ($tending or 0) gte 250 or ($history or 0) gte 260>><<link "趁浪退旋铜盖 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#enc-foghorn-1">>
<<if ($tending or 0) gte 250 or ($history or 0) gte 260>>
	<<set $daily.mpRegEnc_foghorn_1 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg_enc_foghorn_1_alt")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span><</if>><<skulduggery 1>>你算准浪歇间隙拧开铜盖，将里面的旧古铜徽章收入囊中。<span class="green">你顺着退潮节拍打开了浮筒。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[前往别处 (0:04)|MP Region Foghorn Pier]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	藤壶边缘刮红了指腹，海风吹得手指发僵。<span class="red">你按住指腹先退回栈桥。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Encounter Foghorn 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回雾角灯塔 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Pier]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[趁浪退旋铜盖 (0:07)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "趁浪退旋铜盖">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "照料等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 历史等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 7>><</link>><</if>>
</div>
<</if>>


:: MP Region Encounter Foghorn 2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "sea">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>>守塔人旧居阁楼的备用雾角气阀下压着一只铜皮日志匣，锁扣上凝着一层厚盐霜。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Pier]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpRegEnc_foghorn_2 is 1>>
你今天已经把这里的首尾收拾干净，先回前头歇息吧。
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[深入 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Foghorn 8]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
<div id="enc-foghorn-2">
<<sneakicon>><<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($science or 0) gte 260>><<link "化盐霜开扣 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#enc-foghorn-2">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($science or 0) gte 260>>
	<<set $daily.mpRegEnc_foghorn_2 to 1>>
