	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[深入 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Foghorn 8]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	铜扣锈死在槽里，扳动时震麻了指尖。<span class="red">你擦干水迹准备再试。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Encounter Foghorn 2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回雾角栈桥 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Pier]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[化盐霜开扣 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "化盐霜开扣">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 科学等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<if ($tending or 0) gte 250 or ($history or 0) gte 260>><<link "抽出滑槽暗板 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#enc-foghorn-2">>
<<if ($tending or 0) gte 250 or ($history or 0) gte 260>>
	<<set $daily.mpRegEnc_foghorn_2 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg_enc_foghorn_2_alt")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span><</if>><<history 1>>暗板滑开后露出全套守塔记录与一袋航海古铜徽章。<span class="green">你从底座滑槽取出了日志匣存物。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[前往别处 (0:04)|MP Region Foghorn Pier]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	滑槽卡着海沙，拉动到一半便停住不动。<span class="red">你拂去海沙留待稍后再试。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Encounter Foghorn 2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回雾角灯塔 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Pier]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[抽出滑槽暗板 (0:07)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "抽出滑槽暗板">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "照料等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 历史等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 7>><</link>><</if>>
</div>
<</if>>


:: MP Region Moment Clockwork 6 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>>青铜齿轮回廊第三根立柱的分油铜阀卡死在半格，下方的副传动轮因缺油发出干涩尖啸。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:03)|MP Region Clockwork Undercity]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
