	<br><br>
	<<link [[前往别处 (0:04)|MP Region Clockwork Corridor]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	油滴溅在衣袖上，留下一小块深色油斑。<span class="red">你拿棉纱擦净袖口先退回主廊。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gtiredness>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Clockwork 6]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回机括城 (0:03)|MP Region Clockwork Undercity]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[引润滑脂入槽 (0:07)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "引润滑脂入槽">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 照料等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 7>><</link>><</if>>
</div>
<</if>>


:: MP Region Moment Clockwork 7 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>>停摆天文台底座的黄道刻度环卡着半截断掉的钢丝弦，星象指针停在冬至位纹丝不动。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:03)|MP Region Clockwork Undercity]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpRegMom_clockwork_7 is 1>>
桌案与器物都已归置妥帖，今天不用再忙活这一摊了。
<br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[深入 (0:04)|MP Region Encounter Clockwork 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-region-moment-clockwork-7">
<<investigateicon>><<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($science or 0) gte 260>><<link "夹断钢丝 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#act-mp-region-moment-clockwork-7">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($science or 0) gte 260>>
	<<set $daily.mpRegMom_clockwork_7 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg_mom_clockwork_7")>><<money 320>><</if>>断弦取出后星象指针轻快归位，底座暗抽屉弹开半寸。<span class="green">你在抽屉里找到了早年观测补贴。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[探查异动 (0:04)|MP Region Encounter Clockwork 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	钢丝尾端猛地弹起，在你食指上划出一道红痕。<span class="red">你按住手指退到观测椅旁。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Clockwork 7]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回齿轮回廊 (0:03)|MP Region Clockwork Undercity]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[夹断钢丝 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "夹断钢丝">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 科学等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<if ($maths or 0) gte 260 or ($history or 0) gte 260>><<link "拨动副轮绕开 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-region-moment-clockwork-7">>
<<if ($maths or 0) gte 260 or ($history or 0) gte 260>>
	<<set $daily.mpRegMom_clockwork_7 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg_mom_clockwork_7_alt")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span><</if>><<history 1>>副轮带动黄道环平稳旋过死点，暗格里的黄铜小匣随之滑出。<span class="green">你凭星象度数解开了天球仪死扣。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[前往别处 (0:04)|MP Region Clockwork Corridor]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	刻度环阻力太大，推转两圈后手腕酸胀不已。<span class="red">你记下刻度位置决定改日再试。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gtiredness>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Clockwork 7]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回通风处 (0:03)|MP Region Clockwork Undercity]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[拨动副轮绕开 (0:07)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "拨动副轮绕开">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "数学等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 历史等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 7>><</link>><</if>>
</div>
