<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if ($mpAlertArea or "") isnot "abbey">><<mpalertinit "abbey">><</if>><<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>>告解回音壁北侧的石雕圣水盆底座有一道新刮痕，盆底暗孔里塞着一只防水羊皮小囊。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:03)|MP Region Abbey Steps]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpRegEnc_abbey_1 is 1>>
当班与善后的活计今天都已交割清楚，不必再折返。
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[深入 (0:04)|MP Region Encounter Abbey 2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
<div id="enc-abbey-1">
<<sneakicon>><<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($science or 0) gte 260>><<link "挑开盆底皮囊 (0:06)">><<mpalert 8>><<pass 6>><<replace "#enc-abbey-1">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($science or 0) gte 260>>
	<<set $daily.mpRegEnc_abbey_1 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg_enc_abbey_1")>><<money 300>><</if>>羊皮囊里封着古修道院的香油补贴与一枚银质苦修章。<span class="green">你从圣水盆暗孔取出了羊皮小囊。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[探查异动 (0:04)|MP Region Encounter Abbey 2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	冰冷石盆冻得手指发僵，刀尖在石缝里打滑。<span class="red">你收回手指哈了口热气。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Encounter Abbey 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回静默石阶 (0:03)|MP Region Abbey Steps]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<mpalertgain "锁簧与石面的回声">><<else>><<link [[挑开盆底皮囊 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "挑开盆底皮囊">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 科学等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<if ($tending or 0) gte 250 or ($history or 0) gte 260>><<link "按莲花浮雕排水 (0:07)">><<mpalert 8>><<pass 7>><<replace "#enc-abbey-1">>
<<if ($tending or 0) gte 250 or ($history or 0) gte 260>>
	<<set $daily.mpRegEnc_abbey_1 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg_enc_abbey_1_alt")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span><</if>><<skulduggery 1>>积水顺暗管流尽，羊皮小囊自动浮出暗孔落入你手中。<span class="green">你触发排水浮雕拿到了羊皮囊。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[前往别处 (0:04)|MP Region Abbey Steps]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	浮雕石瓣卡着陈年香灰，按下去只动了半寸。<span class="red">你扫净香灰准备再试。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Encounter Abbey 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回古修道院 (0:03)|MP Region Abbey Steps]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<mpalertgain "锁簧与石面的回声">><<else>><<link [[按莲花浮雕排水 (0:07)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "按莲花浮雕排水">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "照料等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 历史等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 7>><</link>><</if>>
</div>
<</if>>


:: MP Region Encounter Abbey 2 [nobr]
