	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg_enc_abbey_2")>><<money 350>><</if>>你稳稳站在船头解下税单，夹层里还裹着几枚渡口古银币。<span class="green">你在暗河拱桥下取下了镇水铃税单。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[深入 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Abbey 8]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	暗河水波晃动船身，铜铃撞出一声闷响。<span class="red">你连忙握紧船桨稳住木舟。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
