	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg_enc_abbey_2_alt")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span><</if>><<history 1>>竹篙稳稳勾住铃环拉近岸边，你不费吹灰之力取下税单与存银。<span class="green">你站在石阶上取下了铜铃秘藏。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[前往别处 (0:04)|MP Region Abbey Steps]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	石阶青苔湿滑，拉竹篙时脚底差点打滑。<span class="red">你踩实干燥石面重新借力。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Encounter Abbey 2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回古修道院 (0:03)|MP Region Abbey Steps]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<mpalertgain "锁簧与石面的回声">><<else>><<link [[拉近石阶铜铃 (0:07)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "拉近石阶铜铃">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "照料等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 历史等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 7>><</link>><</if>>
