	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[深入 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Glasshouse 7]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	气根分泌的微麻汁液沾在手背上，皮肤泛起一阵刺痒。<span class="red">你连忙用清水冲洗干净手背。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Glasshouse 6]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回兰花温室 (0:03)|MP Region Glasshouse Manor]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[修去气根 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "修去气根">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "照料等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 科学等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250 or ($physique or 10000) gte 11300>><<link "旋紧黄铜蜗杆 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-region-moment-glasshouse-6">>
