:: MP Region Encounter Glasshouse 2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>>玻璃穹顶露台的铸铁螺旋梯底柱有一格暗门，门缝里露出一角多瑙河花展的丝绸请柬袋。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:03)|MP Region Glasshouse Orchid]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpRegEnc_glasshouse_2 is 1>>
这里的门道今天已经试过一回，先收好东西离开吧。
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[深入 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Glasshouse 8]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
<div id="enc-glasshouse-2">
<<sneakicon>><<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($science or 0) gte 260>><<link "别开底柱暗门 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#enc-glasshouse-2">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($science or 0) gte 260>>
	<<set $daily.mpRegEnc_glasshouse_2 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg_enc_glasshouse_2")>><<money 350>><</if>>暗门应声弹开，丝绸袋里装着花展贵宾礼金与一枚胸针。<span class="green">你打开旋梯底柱取出了请柬袋。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[深入 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Glasshouse 8]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	铸铁门边角生锈，别动时震得指尖发麻。<span class="red">你揉了揉指尖暂且退开。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Encounter Glasshouse 2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回兰花温室 (0:03)|MP Region Glasshouse Orchid]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[别开底柱暗门 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "别开底柱暗门">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 科学等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<if ($tending or 0) gte 250 or ($history or 0) gte 260>><<link "旋松藤蔓固定销 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#enc-glasshouse-2">>
<<if ($tending or 0) gte 250 or ($history or 0) gte 260>>
	<<set $daily.mpRegEnc_glasshouse_2 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg_enc_glasshouse_2_alt")>><<set $mpHerbsCollected to ($mpHerbsCollected or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得草药 ×1</span><</if>><<history 1>>固定销旋松后暗门自动敞开，你将丝绸袋内的纪念胸针稳妥收起。<span class="green">你顺着藤蔓走向解开了底柱暗门。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[前往别处 (0:04)|MP Region Glasshouse Orchid]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	藤蔓棘刺扎了一下手背，销子只松了半圈。<span class="red">你拨开棘刺准备再试。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Encounter Glasshouse 2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回秘密温室 (0:03)|MP Region Glasshouse Orchid]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[旋松藤蔓固定销 (0:07)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "旋松藤蔓固定销">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "照料等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 历史等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 7>><</link>><</if>>
</div>
<</if>>


:: MP Region Moment Blackiron 6 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "elk">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if ($mpAlertArea or "") isnot "blackiron">><<mpalertinit "blackiron">><</if>><<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>>废弃调车场五号道岔的滑枕上积着厚厚一层煤渣，扳道拉杆卡在半途无法归位。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:03)|MP Region Blackiron Yard]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpRegMom_blackiron_6 is 1>>
今日与对方的交接已经办妥，不必再上前打扰。
<br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[深入 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Blackiron 7]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-region-moment-blackiron-6">
<<investigateicon>><<if ($physique or 10000) gte 11400 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250>><<link "清除滑枕煤渣 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#act-mp-region-moment-blackiron-6">>
<<if ($physique or 10000) gte 11400 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpRegMom_blackiron_6 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg_mom_blackiron_6")>><<money 280>><</if>>煤渣清净后道岔铿然合拢，枕木暗槽里露出一只装有旧路局银币的铁盒。<span class="green">你打通了五号股道的扳道机关。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[深入 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Blackiron 7]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	煤灰扬起呛入喉咙，铁铲磕在钢轨上震麻了虎口。<span class="red">你咳了两声退到背风货车旁。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Blackiron 6]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回调车场 (0:03)|MP Region Blackiron Yard]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[清除滑枕煤渣 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "清除滑枕煤渣">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "体魄：11400 或 家政等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 260 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250>><<link "浇油销轴 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-region-moment-blackiron-6">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 260 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpRegMom_blackiron_6 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg_mom_blackiron_6_alt")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span><</if>><<skulduggery 1>>机油渗入销轴后拉杆轻松落锁，你在油壶底座下摸到了几张零钞。<span class="green">道岔恢复了顺滑切换。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[前往别处 (0:04)|MP Region Blackiron Siding]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	冷风吹斜了油流，机油弄脏了你的鞋面。<span class="red">你用破帆布擦净鞋面退回月台。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gtiredness>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Blackiron 6]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回黑铁货站 (0:03)|MP Region Blackiron Yard]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[浇油销轴 (0:07)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "浇油销轴">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "科学等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 7>><</link>><</if>>
</div>
<</if>>


:: MP Region Moment Blackiron 7 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "elk">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if ($mpAlertArea or "") isnot "blackiron">><<mpalertinit "blackiron">><</if>><<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>>信号塔二楼的发报机备用蓄电池接线柱结了一层白霜，指示灯忽明忽暗。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:03)|MP Region Blackiron Yard]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpRegMom_blackiron_7 is 1>>
现场痕迹已被你抚平，今天无需再多生枝节。
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[深入 (0:04)|MP Region Encounter Blackiron 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-region-moment-blackiron-7">
<<mprepairicon>><<if ($science or 0) gte 260 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250>><<link "打磨接线柱 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#act-mp-region-moment-blackiron-7">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 260 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpRegMom_blackiron_7 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg_mom_blackiron_7")>><<money 320>><</if>>指示灯重新亮起稳定的绿光，电报机底抽屉弹开，露出一叠值班津贴。<span class="green">信号塔备用电路彻底恢复通畅。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[探查异动 (0:04)|MP Region Encounter Blackiron 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	静电火花在指尖啪地闪了一下，麻得你手臂一颤。<span class="red">你放下砂纸退到木桌旁甩了甩手。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Blackiron 7]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回调车场 (0:03)|MP Region Blackiron Yard]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[打磨接线柱 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "打磨接线柱">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "科学等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250 or ($tending or 0) gte 250>><<link "擦净电极 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-region-moment-blackiron-7">>
<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250 or ($tending or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpRegMom_blackiron_7 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg_mom_blackiron_7_alt")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span><</if>><<skulduggery 1>>电极恢复黄铜光泽，电流嗡鸣平稳下来，你在桌角找到一枚纪念铜章。<span class="green">你干净利落地修好了蓄电池组。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[前往别处 (0:04)|MP Region Blackiron Siding]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	刺鼻的煤油味熏得你头昏脑涨，擦拭时碰歪了灯罩。<span class="red">你推开小窗透气，暂且退下信号楼。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gtiredness>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Blackiron 7]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回通风处 (0:03)|MP Region Blackiron Yard]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[擦净电极 (0:07)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "擦净电极">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "家政等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 照料等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 7>><</link>><</if>>
</div>
<</if>>


:: MP Region Encounter Blackiron 1 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "elk">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if ($mpAlertArea or "") isnot "blackiron">><<mpalertinit "blackiron">><</if>><<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>>三号装甲货车底部的制动风管旁挂着一只铁皮押运匣，铁箍上打着旧铁路局的双十字铅封。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:03)|MP Region Blackiron Siding]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpRegEnc_blackiron_1 is 1>>
你拍了拍衣袖上的微尘，今天这桩事已圆满落定。
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[深入 (0:04)|MP Region Encounter Blackiron 2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
<div id="enc-blackiron-1">
<<mplockpickicon>><<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($science or 0) gte 260>><<link "剪断铅封丝 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#enc-blackiron-1">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($science or 0) gte 260>>
	<<set $daily.mpRegEnc_blackiron_1 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg_enc_blackiron_1")>><<money 300>><</if>>铅封应声而断，押运匣里收着护路队的夜班薪饷袋。<span class="green">你干净利落地取下了车底押运匣。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[探查异动 (0:04)|MP Region Encounter Blackiron 2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	车底空间狭窄，钳柄磕在钢梁上震痛了虎口。<span class="red">你钻出车底活动了一下手腕。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
