<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:03)|MP Region Blackiron Siding]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpRegEnc_blackiron_2 is 1>>
屋里屋外都已照料周全，今天先回去歇歇脚吧。
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[深入 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Blackiron 8]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
<div id="enc-blackiron-2">
<<sneakicon>><<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($science or 0) gte 260>><<link "摇半圈松齿 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#enc-blackiron-2">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($science or 0) gte 260>>
	<<set $daily.mpRegEnc_blackiron_2 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg_enc_blackiron_2")>><<money 350>><</if>>齿条上移后帆布袋轻松抽出，里面装着走私账房留下的封口银币。<span class="green">你摇动水闸转轮取出了帆布袋。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[深入 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Blackiron 8]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	转轮沉重异常，硬摇时拉伤了小臂肌肉。<span class="red">你揉着小臂退回月台石阶。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
