	<br>
	<<link [[返回调车场 (0:03)|MP Region Blackiron Siding]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[摇半圈松齿 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "摇半圈松齿">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 科学等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<if ($tending or 0) gte 250 or ($history or 0) gte 260>><<link "垫开铁链脱袋口 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#enc-blackiron-2">>
<<if ($tending or 0) gte 250 or ($history or 0) gte 260>>
	<<set $daily.mpRegEnc_blackiron_2 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg_enc_blackiron_2_alt")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span><</if>><<skulduggery 1>>撬棍一别便解开铁链环扣，你将帆布袋里的古铜徽章尽数收好。<span class="green">你用撬棍巧劲解下了防水帆布袋。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[前往别处 (0:04)|MP Region Blackiron Siding]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	水闸边青苔湿滑，用力时脚下一溜险些摔倒。<span class="red">你扶住砖墙稳住了重心。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Encounter Blackiron 2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回黑铁货站 (0:03)|MP Region Blackiron Siding]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
